#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:45
msgid ""
"This effect/filter overlays GPS-related text onto the image source. **GPS "
"Text** will search for keywords in the text to be overlaid and will replace "
"those keywords on a frame-by-frame basis. It is based on the :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text` effect/filter."
msgstr ""
"Este efeito/filtro sobrepõe texto relacionado ao GPS na imagem original. O "
"**Texto de GPS** busca palavras-chave no texto a ser sobreposto e as "
"substitui quadro a quadro. Ele é baseado no efeito/filtro :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:49
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parâmetros"

